OL,5,G0300 Julia Bradbury's Wonders of the
OL,6,G     Frozen South
OL,7,     FJulia Bradbury journeys to the
OL,8,     Fedge of the world to experience
OL,9,     Fthe beauty and brutal conditions
OL,10,     Fof Antarctica as she explores its
OL,11,     Ficy landscapes and extraordinary
OL,12,     Fwildlife. After crossing the
OL,13,     FSouthern Ocean, Julia's boat is
OL,14,     Fsurrounded by penguins and seals
OL,15,     Fbefore a pod of humpback whales
OL,16,     Ffinally breaks cover to breath and
OL,17,     Ffeed. Following an emotional
OL,18,     Fovernight camp in Paradise Bay,
OL,19,     FJulia then experiences the raw
OL,20,     Fpower of nature thanks to a giant
OL,21,     Ficeberg split
